          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "我的瓶子已经冻成冰了。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-07-10-frozen-bottle-swells_dialogue_001_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "拿出来看看。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-07-10-frozen-bottle-swells_dialogue_002_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "已经胀起来了。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-07-10-frozen-bottle-swells_dialogue_003_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "下次瓶子水装少一点，不然就变成这样子了。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-07-10-frozen-bottle-swells_dialogue_004_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "幸好是塑料的，不然就爆了。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-07-10-frozen-bottle-swells_dialogue_005_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
